# A Problem Solving Tutor for Introductory Genetics in Turbo Pascal.

**Authors:** Browning, Mark E., Lehman, James D.

## Abstract
Discusses the development and field testing of a prototype genetics tutor program for microcomputers written in Turbo Pascal. A preliminary field test with undergraduates is described that was used as formative evaluation, and suggestions are given for designing a more effective tutor that uses additional intelligent computer-assisted instruction techniques. (14 references) (Author/LRW)

